{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And strike</b> — two times: \"strike the dust of the earth\" and \"strike palm to palm.\" This teaches that the lice were striking and slapping against their faces and against all their flesh. The reason for the lice: because the Egyptians prevented Israel from entering the bathhouses, and as a result their garments became filled with lice — therefore they were stricken with lice."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:12:14.489295229Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}